From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] cfgmgr32: range lists (3539)

cfgmgr32: range lists

CM_Create_Range_List, Free, Add, Delete, Test_Range_Available, Dup, Merge, Intersect, Invert, First/Next_Range and Find_Range (with their header declarations). Device changes (create/remove/enable/disable/move/uninstall, hardware profile writes) and the legacy resource descriptor and log configuration calls are not done.
